  "Question": "In uniform motion, $s=vt$. If the speed $v$ is fixed at 5 m/s while the time $t$ and distance $s$ change, how many variables are there in this process?",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "2",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "The value of $v$ does not change, so it is a constant. Both $t$ and $s$ take different values, so they are variables. There are 2 variables in total.",
